{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-50602","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-58121","text":"OpenSentience — Agent Skills"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-50604","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-58122","marks":["bold"],"text":"Purpose:"},{"id":"spn-58123","text":" Teach any LLM connected to the OpenSentience governance shim how to use its MCP tools correctly, idiomatically, and in the right sequence. Drop these files into your MCP client's context so the model knows *when*, *why*, and *how* to call each tool."}]}],"id":"blk-50603","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-50605","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-58124","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-50606","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-58125","text":"Quick Orientation"}]},{"id":"blk-50607","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-58126","text":"OpenSentience is the "},{"id":"spn-58127","marks":["bold"],"text":"governance, diagnostic, and temporal layer"},{"id":"spn-58128","text":" for the [&] Protocol ecosystem. It publishes ten numbered protocols organized in two layers — eight cognitive primitives (OS-001 through OS-008) and two cross-cutting protocols (OS-009 PRISM diagnostic, OS-010 PULSE temporal) — and ships three runtime artifacts: the "},{"id":"spn-58129","marks":["code"],"text":"open_sentience"},{"id":"spn-58130","text":" hex package implementing OS-006 governance shim and OS-008 agent harness, the "},{"id":"spn-58131","marks":["bold"],"text":"PRISM benchmark engine"},{"id":"spn-58132","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-58133","marks":["code"],"text":"/PRISM/"},{"id":"spn-58134","text":"), and the "},{"id":"spn-58135","marks":["bold"],"text":"PULSE manifest standard"},{"id":"spn-58136","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-58137","marks":["code"],"text":"/PULSE/"},{"id":"spn-58138","text":")."}]},{"id":"blk-50608","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-58139","text":"The shim wraps OTP-supervised agents with:"}]},{"id":"blk-50609","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-50611","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-58140","marks":["bold"],"text":"Permissions"},{"id":"spn-58141","text":" — what the agent may access"}]}],"id":"blk-50610","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-50613","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-58142","marks":["bold"],"text":"Lifecycle"},{"id":"spn-58143","text":" — what state the agent is in"}]}],"id":"blk-50612","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-50615","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-58144","marks":["bold"],"text":"Autonomy"},{"id":"spn-58145","text":" — how much independence the agent has"}]}],"id":"blk-50614","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-50617","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-58146","marks":["bold"],"text":"Audit"},{"id":"spn-58147","text":" — an immutable record of everything that happened"}]}],"id":"blk-50616","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-50618","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-58148","text":"The Governance Loop"}]},{"id":"blk-50619","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-58149","text":"Every governed agent follows this rhythm:"}]},{"id":"blk-50620","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"1. INSTALL    → agent_install (register agent + declare permissions)\n2. CONFIGURE  → permission_check (verify grants are correct)\n3. ENABLE     → agent_enable (start the governed process)\n4. MONITOR    → agent_status + autonomy_level (observe behavior)\n5. AUDIT      → agent_audit (review the immutable trail)"},{"id":"blk-50621","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-58150","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-50622","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-58151","text":"Skill Files"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-50624","spans":[{"id":"spn-58152","text":"File"}]},{"id":"blk-50625","spans":[{"id":"spn-58153","text":"What It Teaches"}]}],"id":"blk-50623","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-50626","spans":[{"id":"spn-58154","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/opensentience.org/docs/skills/01_PROTOCOLS_OVERVIEW.md"}],"text":"01_PROTOCOLS_OVERVIEW.md"}]},{"id":"blk-50627","spans":[{"id":"spn-58155","text":"The ten protocols (eight cognitive primitives + OS-009 PRISM + OS-010 PULSE) and their cognitive science grounding"}]}],[{"id":"blk-50628","spans":[{"id":"spn-58156","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/opensentience.org/docs/skills/02_AGENT_LIFECYCLE.md"}],"text":"02_AGENT_LIFECYCLE.md"}]},{"id":"blk-50629","spans":[{"id":"spn-58157","text":"State machine: installed through removed"}]}],[{"id":"blk-50630","spans":[{"id":"spn-58158","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/opensentience.org/docs/skills/03_PERMISSIONS.md"}],"text":"03_PERMISSIONS.md"}]},{"id":"blk-50631","spans":[{"id":"spn-58159","text":"Permission taxonomy, evaluation order, glob patterns"}]}],[{"id":"blk-50632","spans":[{"id":"spn-58160","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/opensentience.org/docs/skills/04_AUTONOMY_LEVELS.md"}],"text":"04_AUTONOMY_LEVELS.md"}]},{"id":"blk-50633","spans":[{"id":"spn-58161","text":"Graduated autonomy: observe, advise, act"}]}],[{"id":"blk-50634","spans":[{"id":"spn-58162","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/opensentience.org/docs/skills/05_AUDIT_TRAILS.md"}],"text":"05_AUDIT_TRAILS.md"}]},{"id":"blk-50635","spans":[{"id":"spn-58163","text":"Append-only audit system and compliance workflows"}]}],[{"id":"blk-50636","spans":[{"id":"spn-58164","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/opensentience.org/docs/skills/06_INTEGRATION.md"}],"text":"06_INTEGRATION.md"}]},{"id":"blk-50637","spans":[{"id":"spn-58165","text":"Integrating with Graphonomous, Delegatic, and [&] ecosystem"}]}],[{"id":"blk-50638","spans":[{"id":"spn-58166","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/opensentience.org/docs/skills/07_COGNITIVE_SCIENCE.md"}],"text":"07_COGNITIVE_SCIENCE.md"}]},{"id":"blk-50639","spans":[{"id":"spn-58167","text":"Research foundations and citations"}]}],[{"id":"blk-50640","spans":[{"id":"spn-58168","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","targ